{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Yeremey, a ranger who returns to his home reserve to visit his father\u2014only to find him missing.<br>Explore the vast forest, uncover traces of the disappeared, and piece together the story hidden in notes, maps, and abandoned places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reserve is dangerous: poachers, wild animals, and the lingering impact of a corporation that disturbed the natural balance. Survive using your skills, protect the land, and discover what happened to your father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Walk through atmospheric forest zones and uncover abandoned industrial sites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight poachers and defend yourself against aggressive animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect herbs and craft potions to heal, calm, or resist poison.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use watchtowers and campsites to prepare for raids and navigate the territory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find notes and records that reveal the story of your father and the corporation\u2019s secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track animals and make decisions that affect the balance of the ecosystem.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Moving forward!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043190/bca2a0d859c578c448890dd3e3275b9a6414a94a.jpg"},{"name":"Let's be friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043190/2a959f5493cc38a972f85c0ae3213aa54ee4c19b.jpg"},{"name":"Belissimo!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043190/ee4f25ddab8a647bdc440b37992aff8c94481621.jpg"},{"name":" Demolitionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043190/b109f7667e1e16317ef1f49640e0230a2dc14c54.jpg"},{"name":"What a goat!","path":"https://cdn.akamai